{"parse": {"title": "山麓的回音-01", "pageid": 135152, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3\" title=\"山麓的回音\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">山麓的回音-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3-02\" title=\"山麓的回音-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">山麓的回音</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"\"></span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> </div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_xueshan\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_xueshan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白色的冰雪覆盖着远处的山峰，伴随着气候的回暖，岩石嶙峋的线条也得以彰显。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但此刻的气候依旧远远称不上怡人——实际上，早春糟糕的温度反倒会让雨后的草地变得更加泥泞难行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但相较于人们会面临的其他困境，糟糕的天气已经是其中最为温和无害的一项了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>所以，我们接下来还会遇到什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>来自山峦另一侧的焚风、难缠的魔精、不知死活的神秘学家难民，又或是来自佩希塔的邪恶把戏？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>埃米尔将自己的靴子从草地拔出，报复般的用登山杖砸了砸一旁的岩石，大声的抱怨道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>见鬼，我受够了这座该死的山脉！塞梅尔维斯队长，我们当时就不应该离开维也纳的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>山地的情况与维也纳所要面对的情况并不相似，但难缠程度有过之而无不及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>不要敲击岩石，埃米尔。别忘了我们还处在塔泽尔虫【tatzelwurm】的领地之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>不过，如果你想被它往你的脑袋上喷上一口臭气，我也不会阻止你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>“我们勇敢的埃米尔，他为神秘学生物研究做出了杰出的贡献——他用脑袋验证了塔泽尔虫牙齿与臭气的威力。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被称做塞梅尔维斯的少女的劝阻显然起到了作用。埃米尔警惕的缩了缩脑袋，小心翼翼的环顾了一圈四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在确认并没有一只散发着臭气的巨型怪物从地底出现后，埃米尔明显的松了一口气。他快走几步，来到了塞梅尔维斯的身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被埃米尔滑稽神态逗乐，周围的四名队员也发出了一阵善意的笑声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>包括埃米尔在内，这是一支由六人组成的小型队伍，位于队伍中央的塞梅尔维斯则是这支队伍的领导者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>别担心，刚刚的只是一个玩笑话，我们不会就这么看着你被怪物袭击的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>多谢提醒，队长。我可不愿意变成一封殉职报告被送到贝尔格莱德分部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>尽管有不少人是为了委外合约人才管理组织丰厚的抚恤金而来，但我显然不在此列。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>经过刚刚的小插曲，埃米尔连说话的声音都刻意的压低了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>不过说真的，队长，我们到底还要在这座该死的山里待多久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>很遗憾，直到我们找到那伙重塑追随者之前，我们都必须与冰冷的睡袋为伍了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>唉……啊，真是要命了。说真的，我们有必要如此紧追不舍吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>这不过就是一伙重塑之手的走狗而已——他们甚至连真正的重塑之手都算不上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>追踪他们的时间，足够我们处理三个任务了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这次任务来自于委外合约人才组织的高层，我们没有拒绝的权力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>而且，尽管对方只是数量众多的分支教派中的一支，但比起一般的重塑门徒，这些狂热的追随者有些时候更为棘手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>他们往往熟知当前社会的规则，能够利用各种途径给我们制造麻烦，掩盖自己的行踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>好吧，也不知道这帮家伙到底有什么了不起的地方，值得高层下达这样的命令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>但要我说，总部如果真想要找到这些重塑信徒，还不如好好查查那些神秘学家难民。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>嗯，我们先前所处理的暴动、谋杀案件，也确实证明了这一点。重塑之手极大可能在煽动这些难民。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>他们大多来自巴尔干半岛，都是遭受了政治斗争与对神秘学家的种族迫害才来到奥匈帝国。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>因此，“神秘学家至上”的理念自然会在这些可怜人中得到广泛的认可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>现在无论是基金会还是奥匈帝国，都在尽力地排查这些难民。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>不过，这么庞大的数量，在短时间内是无法彻底完成排查工作了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>更何况……不，没什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>情绪激动的埃米尔并没有注意到塞梅尔维斯的迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>啧！重塑之手只是在煽动这群白痴给人类制造混乱，根本没有接纳他们的打算！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>这些难民大多都不是纯血种，只是一群混血种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>他们之中绝大部分人甚至终其一生都只能释放出一两个最为简单、毫无威胁的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……即便是神秘学家，也并非人人都能够顺利的使用神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>能够在重塑之手如鱼得水的，多是“尊贵”和“强大”的纯血种。那些试炼……他们根本不在乎无法使用高级神秘术的混血种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>但不少难民已经被那些激进的宣传彻底洗脑了，根本无法考虑重塑之手的承诺是否能够落实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>比被利用更加悲哀的是，被利用完之后还无法拿到自己的报酬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到这里，埃米尔更加气愤了。两人行进中的步伐逐渐加快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>这就是神秘学家！缺乏理性又急不可耐，就像是一群丢失了蜂巢方位的工蜂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>一想到其中有些白痴跟我同样来自塞尔维亚，我就感到耻辱！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这也是我们追踪追随者的原因，越早清理掉这些不稳定因……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯忽然停顿了下来，但她身旁的埃米尔却并未意识到原因，而是奇怪的看向了塞梅尔维斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>怎么了，队长？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>停下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯举起手臂，示意后面的队员警备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在意识到情况不对后，埃米尔的表情迅速的变得严肃了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>你有没有闻到一股臭味？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>像是硫磺与龙海芋混合在一起的气味……是塔泽尔虫？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>我还以为这只是个传说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯若有所思的笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>不得不说，我先前也是这么以为的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>气味很淡，显然它已经离开了很长一段时间了，而且，这边的草地有碾压的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>看起来它是朝着这个方向行进了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>要去看看吗，队长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>嗯，塔泽尔不会无缘无故现身。如果它袭击了其他旅行者，我们需要伸出援手。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "山麓的回音-01"}}